      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú kun tsawaar baraá tla/ángw múk wa ale. Kuri qaas tawa heé Mungú sagadiyuús daandeemooín wa ale. Inós muruudá' muu naa qeemuú wa huúw nee ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i, guri huuw dír geeraá Mungú as tlakweema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A gár ya/aam inós tawa heé tsatsa'aár dír mukdá' liitlakwene nee oo aa dakuus. Asma inósuú kilá' ku liitlaákw baraá muruú yaariire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe gár inós kuwa hariím, slér ilahhooa gan gaas as tlakweemaawós sleeme, ala a as tlakweemaá muu kilooineeká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee i kaahh oo ilaiwa/ameerí ga sláw, tawa kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú. Ala aqo har kudá' taa ateét nee Mungú, adoodár Aroni kura ateét.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe tam Kristo sleeme taa kilós xirfeesiiká tiwa kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú tleehhi. Ala a Mungú guna ilaiwa/ameerí haniís, iri oó',",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Yesu iwa baraakaá yaamuú wa hoót, Mungú guna i /aa/amín ar afór ur, nee ar hhirhheeri, guri firiirín nee nguwa ateetin. Asma Mungú inós gu aleesláy nguwa ba/amisi baraá gwa'araaro. Inós kuri iiárií qaás nee Mungú asma adoodá' tiwa niinaweés, nee adoodá' Mungú nguwa ilaiwawaá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós a Garmoó Mungú. Ala tam adoorihe inós iialooemis guna intsaatsaáhh, as adoodá' kuwa slahh'eemiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe inós kuri bu'uutiís nee Mungú. Bu'uutisaro kuwa hhe'eés, inós tari heé ba/amár alhhe'eesay wásl ngaa huuw dír mukdá' sleémeero inós ngu iialooemisa'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám Mungú guri kaahamusmoó úr wa qaás ar adoodár Melkisedeki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá daanduú kaangwihe atén /ayma'aá yaariir i koomaán awa ni dirhúng i kaahaan. Ala ooaro a gár gawit, asma kuungá' tundu hargawdén gaa tsaahharo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dirhunge geera a gár hariím kuungá' tawa intsaahhatuuse, asma deelór yaariir aa waaráhh iimír kuungá' tunduwa ba/amís. Ala kuungá' tam hamí a intsaahhatuusér sla'á' malé ale, ar nu intsaahhatimis muruuduú geera daanduú axweesantá Munguhe. Ala tam hamí gár kuungá' tunduwa hariím a ilwa, ala a muruú /aymár gawdeneeká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heewo oo ilwaá wa hariím a na/aay, gár ganaa' nee ar tlaakwe paratlaro ga aleeslayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala muruú /aymár gawdén a oo múk urén. Asma inooín muruú hhó' nee oo tlákw kwaa intsaáhh partlituuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
